+
+        * ``{"tool_calls": [...]}``           – returned unchanged
+        * ``{"name": ..., "args": ...}``      – wrapped as ``{"tool_calls": [item]}``
+        * ``[{"name": ..., "args": ...}, ...]`` – wrapped as ``{"tool_calls": list}``
+        * JSON string encoding any of the above – parsed, then normalised
